# Send to HyperFrames — Launch Film (BRIEF)

Launch video for the Claude Design → "Send to HyperFrames" connection
(heygenverse launch page: /pl/send-to-hyperframes-claude-design-import-du6qic — org-gated).

## The feature (one line)

Design a motion graphic in Claude Design, click **Send to HyperFrames**, and it becomes a
hosted HeyGen project — enhanced with sound and motion polish by the enhance agent, then
cloud-rendered to MP4. Import free, enhance free, render is the paid step.

## Aesthetic — "Claude paper launch"

Match Anthropic's Claude launch-film language, not HeyGen's:

- **Ground:** warm ivory/cream paper (#F0EEE6 family), soft paper grain (CSS grain, GRADE
  not motion), generous whitespace.
- **Ink:** near-black warm ink (#191919 / #3D3929).
- **Accent:** Claude coral/terracotta (#D97757 / #CC785C) — spent sparingly (cursor,
  send action, underlines, the CTA).
- **Type:** serif display in the Claude register (Copernicus/Tiempos-class; pick a
  licensed stand-in and inline it), lowercase-calm sentence case, dramatic weight contrast.
- **Craft:** UI windows sit on the paper like cut-paper cards — real drop shadows, slight
  rotation offsets in the grid, tactile. No glassmorphism, no dark-mode SaaS gradients.
