## Format

- SQUARE 1:1, 1080×1080 (Jake, design pass v2). Target ~45–55s (music-driven; no VO unless Jake asks).
- Claude Design UI is canvas-first: start screen with workflow option cards (Slides /
  Landing page / Creative / Animation / Prototype), chat rail left + dotted canvas,
  zoom + timeline pills, region-select handles, Share menu with Export (HTML / Canva /
  PDF / PowerPoint) + Connectors → Send to HyperFrames. Mock pending REAL captures —
  Jake must log into claude.ai (and app.heygen.com) in the browser pane for plates.
- Audio: warm minimal bed + tactile paper/UI SFX (cuelume set approved). The silent→sound
  contrast is itself the story: the film can go near-silent during the Claude Design
  beats and BLOOM into full sound when HyperFrames enhances — audio enacts the value prop.
- Current: LEFT. Reserved vectors: Z-pull for the grid reveal (beat 3), Z-push for
  re-entry (beat 4), upward for the text beat (beat 5).

